      "x": 269,
      "y": 116.99999,
      "image": "Cold Arrow.png",
      "Desc": "Fire an arrow at the enemy, dealing Physical DMG equal to 100% ATK.<br>On crit, apply 10 stacks of \"Bleed\" for 2 turns.<br>",
      "NumericDesc": "\"Bleed\" stacks：10<br>Range：2,3,4<br>ATK DMG：100% / 110% / 120%<br>Cooldown：2turns.<br>Sanity Cost：15 / 25 / 35",
      "Story": "Perhaps it's \"hunter's\" intuition—Green Roland always strikes in the gap when enemies catch their breath. But is it really as he says?<br>\"Whew, saves time and effort. If one arrow can solve it, don't wait for a second.\"",
